    "briefing": "This’ll be a fun one for you. We just got word that a transport ship has broken down at [Location]. Only problem is, every skag and their mother seems to know about it. Place is crawling with all kinds of outlaws trying to get their hands on the cargo onboard. That’s where you come in.\n\nIf you can get your best pilots together and a heavy-duty tractor beam you can take out the competition and snag the cargo. It ain’t gonna be easy though. One of my scouts said the assholes guarding this ship have got some serious tech on them.  \n\nI’ve already got a buyer waiting, you just need to take the cargo to the freight elevator at [Destination] and I’ll send you the creds.\n\nStows out.",
